WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.107
Farmer came home.

2
00:00:33.108 --> 00:00:38.918
He saw the tractor.

3
00:00:38.919 --> 00:00:42.468
"Oh no!" said Farmer.

4
00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:54.020
"How did the tractor get in the pond?"

5
00:00:54.021 --> 00:01:02.504
Farmer looked at Dog and Cow.

6
00:01:02.505 --> 00:01:08.347
He looked at Cat and Bat.

7
00:01:08.348 --> 00:01:16.342
He looked at Pig.

8
00:01:16.343 --> 00:01:19.782
Farmer went into the house.

9
00:01:19.783 --> 00:01:22.571
He picked up the phone.

10
00:01:22.572 --> 00:01:25.549
"Hello," he said.

11
00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:30.305
"I need a tow truck."

12
00:01:30.306 --> 00:01:44.942
Soon a tow truck came to the farm.

13
00:01:44.943 --> 00:01:52.914
The truck went to the pond.

14
00:01:52.915 --> 00:01:58.590
A man put a hook on the tractor.

15
00:01:58.591 --> 00:02:02.706
The truck pulled the tractor.

16
00:02:02.707 --> 00:02:07.005
The tractor came out of the pond.

17
00:02:07.006 --> 00:02:10.638
"Well, Pig," said Cow.

18
00:02:10.639 --> 00:02:13.909
"I hope you learned your lesson.

19
00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:17.783
You should not drive the tractor."

20
00:02:17.784 --> 00:02:21.560
"Don't worry," said Pig.

21
00:02:21.561 --> 00:02:25.612
"I don't want to drive the tractor anymore.

22
00:02:25.613 --> 00:02:35.472
Now I want to drive that truck!"

